cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use spmkit-phantoms in research, please cite this software."
title: "spmkit-phantoms — deterministic synthetic surfaces and controlled artifacts for SPM validation"
abstract: "Generator of analytical 2D surfaces with known parameters and controlled SPM-like corruptions for software verification and benchmark construction. Clean-versus-observed separation, explicit seeds, canonical hashes and reproducible export bundles."
type: software
